{"id": "short-he-0000", "lang": "he", "category": "short", "text": "שביתה שיבשה את הדואר.", "source": "Tatoeba (OPUS-Tatoeba v2023-04-12 mono)", "license": "CC-BY-2.0-FR"}
{"id": "short-he-0001", "lang": "he", "category": "short", "text": "אני שונא את הכל!", "source": "Tatoeba (OPUS-Tatoeba v2023-04-12 mono)", "license": "CC-BY-2.0-FR"}
{"id": "short-he-0002", "lang": "he", "category": "short", "text": "הפשיסט הטוב היחיד הוא פשיסט מת.", "source": "Tatoeba (OPUS-Tatoeba v2023-04-12 mono)", "license": "CC-BY-2.0-FR"}
{"id": "short-he-0003", "lang": "he", "category": "short", "text": "כל החתולים יפים.", "source": "Tatoeba (OPUS-Tatoeba v2023-04-12 mono)", "license": "CC-BY-2.0-FR"}
{"id": "short-he-0004", "lang": "he", "category": "short", "text": "וַיֹּאמֶר אֱלֹהִים יְהִי אוֹר וַיְהִי-אוֹר.", "source": "Tatoeba (OPUS-Tatoeba v2023-04-12 mono)", "license": "CC-BY-2.0-FR"}
{"id": "short-he-0005", "lang": "he", "category": "short", "text": "וְנֹחַ מָצָא חֵן בְּעֵינֵי יְהֹוָה:", "source": "Tatoeba (OPUS-Tatoeba v2023-04-12 mono)", "license": "CC-BY-2.0-FR"}
{"id": "short-he-0006", "lang": "he", "category": "short", "text": "האנטישמיות היא הסוציאליזם של הטפשים.", "source": "Tatoeba (OPUS-Tatoeba v2023-04-12 mono)", "license": "CC-BY-2.0-FR"}
{"id": "short-he-0007", "lang": "he", "category": "short", "text": "אין אלוה מלבד אלוהים.", "source": "Tatoeba (OPUS-Tatoeba v2023-04-12 mono)", "license": "CC-BY-2.0-FR"}
{"id": "short-he-0008", "lang": "he", "category": "short", "text": "אין אל חוץ מאלוהים.", "source": "Tatoeba (OPUS-Tatoeba v2023-04-12 mono)", "license": "CC-BY-2.0-FR"}
{"id": "short-he-0009", "lang": "he", "category": "short", "text": "יש בנות עם פין, בנים עם פות וטרנספובים בלי שיניים.", "source": "Tatoeba (OPUS-Tatoeba v2023-04-12 mono)", "license": "CC-BY-2.0-FR"}
{"id": "short-he-0010", "lang": "he", "category": "short", "text": "למילי יש חתול.", "source": "Tatoeba (OPUS-Tatoeba v2023-04-12 mono)", "license": "CC-BY-2.0-FR"}
{"id": "short-he-0011", "lang": "he", "category": "short", "text": "פשיסט טוב זה פשיסט מת.", "source": "Tatoeba (OPUS-Tatoeba v2023-04-12 mono)", "license": "CC-BY-2.0-FR"}
{"id": "short-he-0012", "lang": "he", "category": "short", "text": "אנחנו רוצים לקנות בית חדש.", "source": "Tatoeba (OPUS-Tatoeba v2023-04-12 mono)", "license": "CC-BY-2.0-FR"}
{"id": "short-he-0013", "lang": "he", "category": "short", "text": "אני רואה את האריה הלבן.", "source": "Tatoeba (OPUS-Tatoeba v2023-04-12 mono)", "license": "CC-BY-2.0-FR"}
{"id": "short-he-0014", "lang": "he", "category": "short", "text": "המלחמה בתימן חייבת להסתיים.", "source": "Tatoeba (OPUS-Tatoeba v2023-04-12 mono)", "license": "CC-BY-2.0-FR"}
{"id": "short-he-0015", "lang": "he", "category": "short", "text": "תום לא טראמפ.", "source": "Tatoeba (OPUS-Tatoeba v2023-04-12 mono)", "license": "CC-BY-2.0-FR"}
{"id": "short-he-0016", "lang": "he", "category": "short", "text": "היה לנו חתול.", "source": "Tatoeba (OPUS-Tatoeba v2023-04-12 mono)", "license": "CC-BY-2.0-FR"}
{"id": "short-he-0017", "lang": "he", "category": "short", "text": "יש לנו חתול.", "source": "Tatoeba (OPUS-Tatoeba v2023-04-12 mono)", "license": "CC-BY-2.0-FR"}
{"id": "short-he-0018", "lang": "he", "category": "short", "text": "אני חתולה.", "source": "Tatoeba (OPUS-Tatoeba v2023-04-12 mono)", "license": "CC-BY-2.0-FR"}
{"id": "short-he-0019", "lang": "he", "category": "short", "text": "תום הוא מתורגמן.", "source": "Tatoeba (OPUS-Tatoeba v2023-04-12 mono)", "license": "CC-BY-2.0-FR"}
